REQUIREMENTS
------------

- Python
- Python package numpy
- Python package biobox (download from https://github.com/degiacom/biobox)
- Modeller (see: https://salilab.org/modeller/download_installation.html)


FILES
-----

autopatch.py


   Functions performing automatic patching of a PBD file, i.e. automatically adding missing amino acids. Call:

   autopatch(pdb_filename, gap_cutoff=8)

   pdb_filename: the file to curate
   gap_cutoff: integer indicating the maximal gap size acceptable for automatic patching (prevent modelling of excessively long loops.


get_data.py


   download files listed in a .csv file, clean them and call autopatch.py if gaps are detected.
